{"4916370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "10 Beautiful Postcards", "steam_appid": 4916370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916370/extras/23e63c33de40a5c70b6a28d1db9b7b3e.avif?t=1786954893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4916370/extras_big/23e63c33de40a5c70b6a28d1db9b7b3e.avif?t=1786954893 width=1560 height=1218 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE IMAGE IS HOTEL TO THE BRAIN </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A luxury hotel for your hands and eyes, on the computer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the arrows you will move around the glamorous hotel reviewer Pesky, as she drifts through walls and across fields of carpet in search of the perfect hotel destination. More than 200 multimedia fragment collages to roam around. Take snapshots of your friends and climb inside strange paintings. Learn all about the mysterious qualities of the wandering gaze. Glimpse the horrible economy of the hotel dimension, or just 'hang loose' and relax in the pool. There are no bad decisions, apart from the one that you just made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam rerelease of 2019's world class videogame, by the later perpetrators of <strong>ANTHOLOGY OF THE KILLER</strong>. Collage heaps by <strong>thecatamites (SPACE FUNERAL)</strong>, multimedia OST by <strong>TOMMY TONE (GOBLET GROTTO)</strong>, hotel cosmology murals by <strong>A. Degen (SOFT X-RAY / MINDHUNTERS)</strong>, postcards by <strong>Em Reed (MORE BUGS)</strong>. 2+ hours of gameplay, 200+ rooms of wallpaper. Feat. controller support and alternate resolution modes. Check in today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a